  "dcterms:title": "UniProt (Universal Protein Resource) RDF",
  "dcterms:description": "A BioBricks knowledge-graph brick built from the UniProt RDF release, a freely accessible database of protein sequence and functional information produced by the UniProt Consortium (EMBL-EBI, SIB, PIR). The stages/01_download.sh stage downloads the current-release RDF from the UniProt FTP (ftp.uniprot.org/pub/databases/uniprot/current_release/rdf/) via its RELEASE.metalink, and stages/02_build.sh builds the brick.",
