  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude, slice items[1608:1614]). UniProt data is downloaded from the official UniProt FTP current release. UniProt's data-license policy is Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), applied to all copyrightable parts of its databases since 2018; classified attribution / commercial-use conditional (permitted with attribution). HUMAN REVIEW NEEDED: I could not retrieve a verbatim quote from https://www.uniprot.org/help/license (the page returned a JavaScript app-shell to the fetcher, and the REST/FTP LICENSE endpoints returned errors; note that the MIT LICENSE in the ebi-uniprot GitHub org covers the website software, NOT the data). A reviewer should confirm the current CC BY 4.0 statement on the live UniProt license page before treating as authoritative.",
